## Soare syntax highlighting rules for Nano

syntax "soare" "\.soare$"
magic "Soare script"
comment "?"

## built-in objects
color cyan "\<(None|Number|String)\>"
## built-in functions
color cyan "\<(isset|StoN|NtoS)\>"
## Keywords
color brightblue "\<(continue|do|else|end|enumerate|function|if|iferror|loadimport|nop|orif|prompt|raise|return|try|while|writeln)\>"

## operators
color magenta "[.:;,+*|=!\%@]" "<" ">" "/" "-" "&"

## parentheses
color magenta "[()]"

## numbers
icolor brightyellow "\b(([1-9][0-9]+)|0+)\.[0-9]+j?\b" "\b([1-9][0-9]*[Lj]?)\b" "\b0o?[0-7]*L?\b" "\b0x[1-9a-f][0-9a-f]*L?\b" "\b0b[01]+\b"

## strings
color yellow "[`][^`]*[^\\][`]" "[`]{3}.*[^\\][`]{3}"
color yellow "['][^']*[^\\][']" "[']{3}.*[^\\][']{3}"
color yellow "["][^"]*[^\\]["]" "["]{3}.*[^\\]["]{3}"

## comment
color green "\?.*"

## reminders
color brightwhite,yellow "(FIXME|TODO)"